+    /// **The reason the cap exists.** A forward step larger than the cap is
+    /// not reflected all at once: the excess is deferred rather than refused,
+    /// and closes on its own as real time passes.
+    ///
+    /// `ucal wallclock` reads the clock twenty times a second, and a jump this
+    /// size handed to a single reading would take the face from one time to a
